{
  "category": "Barrier Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "If interrupted while it is miming, it will slap around the offender with its broad hands.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "If interrupted while it is miming, it will slap around the offender with its broad hands.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always practices its pantomime act. It makes enemies believe something exists that really doesn't.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "A skilled mime from birth, it gains the ability to create invisible objects as it matures.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its fingertips emit a peculiar force field that hardens air to create an actual wall.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses the mysterious power it has in its fingers to solidify air into an invisible wall.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once it is believed, it will exist as if it were a real thing.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once it is believed, it will exist as if it were a real thing.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. It can convince others that something unseeable actually exists. Once believed, the imaginary object does become real.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able to create walls out of thin air by miming.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "If interrupted while it is miming, it will suddenly DOUBLESLAP the offender with its broad hands.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a pantomime expert that can create invisible but solid walls using miming gestures.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Emanations from its fingertips solidify the air into invisible walls that repel even harsh attacks.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "A skilled mime from birth, it gains the ability to create invisible objects as it matures.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
