    {
      "text": "It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able to create walls out of thin air by miming.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. Mime is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once the watchers are convinced, the unseeable thing exists as if it were real.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mr. Mime is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once the watchers are convinced, the unseeable thing exists as if it were real.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its pantomime skills are wonderful. You may become enraptured while watching it, but next thing you know, Mr. Mime has made a real wall.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It creates invisible walls with its pantomiming. If you don’t act impressed, it will attack you with a double slap!",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always practicing its pantomime act. It makes enemies believe something exists that really doesn’t.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Always practicing its pantomime act. It makes enemies believe something exists that really doesn’t.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "The broadness of its hands may be no coincidence—many scientists believe its palms became enlarged specifically for pantomiming.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s known for its top-notch pantomime skills. It protects itself from all sorts of attacks by emitting auras from its fingers to create walls.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "The behavior of this clown-like Pokémon reminds one of pantomime. It creates invisible walls using a force emitted from its fingertips.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
